@startuml
' Figure 43.9  Collections: the human gate
' Reading order: top to bottom. A borrower's reply carries a hardship
' signal; the agent's proposal arrives flagged; the policy engine
' refuses it, holds every send, and hands the case summary to the
' hardship team with a four-hour promise; only a person clears the
' flag; the reconciler reads the delivery log and finds no send after
' the flag. From designs/data/lender-collections.toml.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Agent" as A <<model>>
participant "Policy" as P <<policy>>
participant "Hardship" as H <<org>>
participant "Reconciler" as R <<verified>>
note over A $F_OPS : Reply: lost my job
A -> P : Plan, flagged
P -[$POLICY]> A : Refused
P -> H : Summary, 4 hours
H -> P : Person clears flag
R -> P : No send after flag
@enduml
